    "title": "Equestrian Center back in the saddle again - NewsBreak",
    "text": "13 hours ago The Minnesota Equestrian Center (MEC) recently rebuilt its north barn, which was lost in a 2024 fire, just in time for one of its largest events of the year, a barrel racing competition that drew hundreds from across the tri-state area. The event packed the 350-stall facility with riders of all ages connected by a shared love of competition and horses. Read full article",
